    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>p</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>q</mi></math> be roots of the equation <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;and let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>r</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>s</mi></math> be the roots of the equation <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>18</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>.&nbsp;If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>p</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mi>q</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mi>r</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mi>s</mi></math> are in arithmetic progression, then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi></math> are",
